## Evidence and decision contract

Judge plan compliance, security, correctness, performance, maintainability, and testing.

Base the decision on the current work product and command output you obtain. Treat handoff summaries as locators, not proof. Bring fresh evidence by inspecting the relevant repository state and running the checks needed for the decision.

Report only concrete, actionable gaps you can prove in this session. For each gap, cite the path or command output and give the next iteration an exact fix and check. When a requirement cannot be evaluated from available evidence, disclose that limit in the summary rather than treating it as a gap.
